    {
      "text": "Fairy Zi Wei names Gong clan among the three Western Desert forces that control a tributary of the River of Time. Gong clan Gu Immortals are proficient in long-range fighting methods, especially curse related killer moves that can kill silently at enormous range. Their most famous immortal killer move, bow shadow cup, needs only a trace of the target’s shadow and can kill no matter how far apart the distance; it has terrorized Western Desert’s Gu Immortal world.",
