    },
    {
      "text": "Wan clan’s expedition alliance against Fang clan includes Gong clan among Xiao, Qin, Sun, Shi, and Tang clans. Gong clan sends Gong Jiao Che, whose battle accomplishments Fang clan immortals already know. Western Desert’s super forces are listed as fourteen clans, including Gong clan.",
